  unitName: God Atro
  unitId: 50014
  unitNumber: 20
  description: A swordsman from the ruined La Veda Republic. One of the Six Heroes,
    he faced the great battle with the gods wielding the Light Sword Urias. He struggled
    with whether or not to fight the gods, but finally decided to when they destroyed
    the monastery he grew up in. He cut down the gods in a rage, breaking with his
    former reputation as a graceful master swordsman.
  summonDesc: My sword is yours, always!<br>Now, it's time to release<br>Urias' true
    power!
  fusionDesc: I still lack power!<br>Grant me the power to <br>defeat the gods!
  evoDesc: Light Sword Urias!<br>Give your master the strength<br>to suppress evil!
  element: 5
  rarity: 4
